nce her son  was always a giver she has chosen to  donate his body to science Metro Police  have not made any arrest in this case  and if you have any information about  the suspects you were asked to call  crime stopper hours that number is  702-385-5555 reporting from the west  side of the valley Victoria Saha live  local now
 

